# TaskMate – Personalised AI Assistant for Daily Task Management

## Project Overview
TaskMate is a university computing project designed to help users organise their daily tasks, manage priorities, and keep track of deadlines in one place.

## Aim
The aim of TaskMate is to develop a simple and user-friendly application that helps people manage their daily routines and improve productivity.

## Objectives
- Allow users to add, view, edit, and delete tasks.
- Enable users to set task priorities and due dates.
- Allow users to mark tasks as completed.
- Provide a clear and easy-to-use interface.
- Test the application to evaluate its usability and functionality.

## Proposed Technologies
- **Frontend:** HTML and CSS
- **Backend:** Python and Flask
- **Database:** SQLite
- **Design and prototyping:** Penpot
- **Version control and collaboration:** GitHub

